# Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (50-50): the last Horde visit of Stranglethorn and the
# Swamp of Sorrows, with a short trip back to Dustwallow Marsh, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/stranglethorn_vale_swamp_of_sorrows_50_50.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Stranglethorn Vale, area
# 33; Swamp of Sorrows, area 8). The quest list is section 14 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md:
# the last Mastery quests of Nesingwary, the Bloodsail captains, Captain Smotts and Negolash, the
# messages in bottles, the OOX reward, Cortello's riddles, the Swamp Talker and the Fallen Hero, and
# the challenge of Overlord Mok'Morokk in Brackenwall.
# Carried from earlier guides (skipped by those who lack them): Deliver to MacKinley (2874, Stoley in
# Tanaris), Report Back to Fizzlebub (1122, Kravel Koalbeard in Thousand Needles), Whiskey Slim's
# Lost Grog (580, taken in Booty Bay, its port found in the Hinterlands), Return to Fel'Zerul (1444,
# the Atal'ai Exile in the Hinterlands) and the three OOX rescues (2767 Feralas, 648 Tanaris, 836 the
# Hinterlands), handed in to Oglethorpe in Booty Bay before An OOX of Your Own.
# Cortello's Riddle (626) is left out: its treasure is in the Hinterlands, which no later guide visits.
# Data fixed here: State Secrets (96379) has no quest before it (outof.games lists only level 48);
# the Document Box it wants is sold at the auction house.
#
# The route: Orgrimmar (the auction house) and the zeppelin to Grom'gol; Nesingwary's camp for
# Tethis and King Bangalash; Booty Bay and a loop south (Mok'rash, the Bloodsail ships, Negolash, the
# beaches and Jaguero Isle); a flight to Stonard and a loop through the Swamp (the Swamp Talker, the
# Fallen Hero, the bridge); the flight and zeppelin to Orgrimmar and on to Brackenwall Village for
# Mok'Morokk and the second riddle; the hearthstone back to Stonard for the Blasted Lands.

guide Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (50-50)
faction horde
levels 50 50
carry 580 1122 1444 2874 3568 3908 4120
leave 3568 3908 4120
next Blasted Lands (50-51)

# Orgrimmar -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Orgrimmar
ah 96379.1 npc 8673
tip State Secrets, in Booty Bay, wants a Document Box: no mob in these zones drops it, so buy one here (about 28 gold, more than the quest pays). Skip State Secrets if you would rather keep the gold.

# Nesingwary's camp ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Stranglethorn Vale
goto "Take the zeppelin from the towers outside Orgrimmar's gate to Grom'gol Base Camp" at 31.5,29.4 r 30
accept 197
tip Ride north from Grom'gol to Nesingwary's camp.
do 197
tip Tethis is a level 43 elite raptor that roams the hills south of Grom'gol.
turnin 197
accept 208
do 208
tip King Bangalash, a level 43 elite white tiger, stands on the hilltop south-east of Grom'gol and calls two tigers to help him at half health.
turnin 208

# Booty Bay -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Booty Bay, Stranglethorn" npc 1387
turnin 2874
tip "Sea Wolf" MacKinley is inside the inn.
turnin 1122
turnin 580
tip Crank Fizzlebub and Whiskey Slim are on the ground floor of the inn.
accept 608
tip Fleet Master Seahorn is up on the balcony of the inn.
accept 3721
turnin 3721
accept 96379 nopre
do 96379 at 28.5,75.8 icon text "Give Rix Xizzix the Document Box"
turnin 96379

# Mok'rash and Captain Smotts -----------------------------------------------------------------------

accept 8552 at 23.3,72.1 "Kill Mok'rash for the Monogrammed Sash, then read it"
tip Mok'rash is a level 50 elite ogre who walks the shore just north-west of Booty Bay.
turnin 8552
accept 8553
turnin 8553
accept 8554

# The Bloodsail ships -------------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 608.2
tip The three captains are on the middle decks of the three Bloodsail ships south of Booty Bay; the ships are full of buccaneers.
do 608.3
do 608.1
accept 624 at 30.6,90.2 "Find Cortello's Riddle, a rolled-up scroll below deck on one of the ships, and read it"
tip The scroll lies on the middle or lower deck of one ship only: look on each as you clear it.

# Negolash, the beaches and Jaguero Isle ------------------------------------------------------------

do 8554
tip Negolash is a level 52 elite giant by the Ruined Lifeboat on the shore north of the ships.
accept 594 at 36.6,77.1 "Open Half-Buried Bottles on the beach until one holds a Carefully Folded Note, then read it"
tip The small green bottles lie at the water's edge along the beaches east of Booty Bay; only some hold a note, and each of you needs one.
turnin 594
tip Princess Poobah is on Jaguero Isle, just off the beach.
accept 630
do 630
tip King Mukla is a level 50 elite ape on the south of the isle.
turnin 630

# Booty Bay -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 608
turnin 8554

# Stonard -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Stonard, Swamp of Sorrows" npc 2858
map Swamp of Sorrows
turnin 1444
tip Fel'zerul is upstairs in the great hall.
accept 2623
bind 6930

# The Swamp Talker, the Fallen Hero and the bridge --------------------------------------------------

do 2623
tip The Swamp Talker walks the cave in the south-east of the swamp (its mouth is near 66,77); look on the upper level at the back first.
turnin 2623
tip The Fallen Hero of the Horde stands alone in the south-west of the swamp.
accept 2801
do 2801 icon talk "Listen to the Fallen Hero of the Horde tell his tale"
turnin 2801
turnin 624
tip The Soggy Scroll is under water, below the bridge on the road west to Deadwind Pass.
accept 625

# Orgrimmar -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Grom'gol, Stranglethorn" npc 6026
note "Take the zeppelin at Grom'gol to Orgrimmar" at 31.5,29.4 in Stranglethorn_Vale
map Orgrimmar
train 3353 3352 3327 6018 3344 5885 3326
tip Paladins and druids have no trainer here: paladins train in Undercity or Thunder Bluff, druids in Thunder Bluff.
fly "Brackenwall Village, Dustwallow Marsh" npc 3310

# Brackenwall Village and the riddle cave -----------------------------------------------------------

map Dustwallow Marsh
accept 1173
do 1173 at 36.4,31.4 mobs 4500 icon kill "Fight Overlord Mok'Morokk until he gives up"
tip He is a level 45 elite and turns on you as soon as you accept; he yields at about a third of his health.
turnin 1173
tip Draz'Zilb is in the small cave at the south end of the village.
turnin 625
tip The Musty Scroll is in a small cave in the south-west of the marsh.

# Back to Stonard -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

hearth npc 6930
note "Ride south out of Stonard along the road into the Blasted Lands for the next guide" npc 6930
